---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy — OtterSave"
  description="OtterSave privacy policy — we collect almost nothing."
>
  <h1 class="woodsign text-xl md:text-2xl">Privacy Policy</h1>
  <div class="card mt-6 space-y-4 text-coco-light">
    <p class="font-body">OtterSave is a static website. All calculations happen locally in your browser — we never see or store your numbers.</p>
    <p class="font-body">We use Cloudflare (our hosting/CDN provider) which may process standard server logs (IP, user agent) for security and performance.</p>
    <p class="font-body">We do not use cookies for tracking today. If we later add advertising or analytics, this policy will be updated and this page will clearly state what is collected.</p>
    <p class="font-body">Contact: <b class="text-coco">hello@ottersave.com</b></p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
